 los reportes, incluyendo el fotogrÃ¡fico.  PRECIOS Y VALIDEZ:  Los precios tienen una validez de 30 dÃ­as.  CONDICIONES DE PAGO:  100 % a 90 dÃ­as despuÃ©s deÂ concluir el servicio.</cbc:Note><cbc:DocumentCurrencyCode>MXN</cbc:DocumentCurrencyCode><cac:ValidityPeriod><cbc:EndDate>2026-02-19</cbc:EndDate></cac:ValidityPeriod><cac:BuyerCustomerParty><cac:Party><cac:PartyName><cbc:Name>EATON TECHNOLOGIES, Gerardo Figueroa</cbc:Name></cac:PartyName><cac:PostalAddress><cbc:StreetName>AVENIDA REAL DE MAYORAZGO No. 130 PISO 124 Col. XOCO,</cbc:StreetName><cbc:AdditionalStreetName>Benito JuÃ¡rez</cbc:AdditionalStreetName><cbc:CityName>MÃ©xico</cbc:CityName><cbc:PostalZone>03330</cbc:PostalZone><cbc:CountrySubentity>Ciudad de MÃ©xico</cbc:CountrySubentity><cac:Country><cbc:IdentificationCode>MX</cbc:IdentificationCode></cac:Country></cac:PostalAddress><cac:PartyTaxScheme><cbc:CompanyID>ETE9603221A4</cbc:CompanyID><cac:TaxScheme><cbc:ID>VAT</cbc:ID></cac:TaxScheme></cac:PartyTaxScheme><cac:PartyLegalEntity><cbc:RegistrationName>EATON TECHNOLOGIES</cbc:RegistrationName><cbc:CompanyID>ETE9603221A4</cbc:CompanyID></cac:PartyLegalEntity><cac:Contact><cbc:Name>Gerardo Figueroa</cbc:Name><cbc:Telephone>6451040786</cbc:Telephone><cbc:ElectronicMail>GerardoGFigueroa@eaton.com</cbc:ElectronicMail></cac:Contact></cac:Party></cac:BuyerCustomerParty><cac:SellerSupplierParty><cac:Party><cac:PartyName><cbc:Name>SISTEMAS ELECTRICOS ZARAGOZA</cbc:Name></cac:PartyName><cac:PostalAddress><cbc:StreetName>Cda. Los Pinos No. 8 A</cbc:StreetName><cbc:AdditionalStreetName>Francisco I. Madero</cbc:AdditionalStreetName><cbc:CityName>Cuautla</cbc:CityName><cbc:PostalZone>62744</cbc:PostalZone><cbc:CountrySubentity>Morelos</cbc:CountrySubentity><cac:Country><cbc:IdentificationCode>MX</cbc:IdentificationCode></cac:Country></cac:PostalAddress><cac:PartyTaxScheme><cbc:CompanyID>SEZ121221V69</cbc:CompanyID><cac:TaxScheme><cbc:ID>VAT</cbc:ID></cac:TaxScheme></cac:PartyTaxScheme><cac:PartyLegalEntity><cbc:R